  {
    "id": 246,
    "name": "2. Empathize",
    "visible": 1,
    "summary": "<div style=\"padding:0 2rem\">\r\n    <h3>Empathize</h3>\r\n    <p>In this module, you will apply methods from the empathize process step to develop a problem statement, stakeholder map, empathy map, and journey map. After this module, you will be able to collect information from an interview to compose an empathy map, define a human-centered problem that is solution-agnostic, map stakeholders, identify customer groups for research and influential groups for relationship building, and create a journey map that illustrates a customer experience.</p>\r\n    Do you have questions? Send an email to <a href=\"mailto:hello@innovate-us.org\">hello@innovate-us.org</a>\r\n</div>",
