  {
    "id": 248,
    "name": "4. Ideate",
    "visible": 1,
    "summary": "<div style=\"padding:0 2rem\">\r\n    <h3>Ideate</h3>\r\n    <p>In this module, you will apply methods from the ideate process step to generate and evaluate ideas and develop a concept solution. you will be able to generate different ideas to solve a problem and evaluate a set of ideas based on their customer desirability, technical feasibility, and viability. Additionally, you will be able to develop a solution concept that explains the customer, the problem addressed, how it works, assumptions made, and the next steps for implementation.</p>\r\n    Do you have questions? Send an email to <a href=\"mailto:hello@innovate-us.org\">hello@innovate-us.org</a>\r\n</div>",
