    "name": "5. Prototype and Test",
    "visible": 1,
    "summary": "<div style=\"padding:0 2rem\">\r\n    <h3>Prototype and Test</h3>\r\n    <p>In this module, you will demonstrate an understanding of rapid prototyping and this knowledge to prototype and test their concept with a customer. you will be able to describe the value and characteristics of rapid prototyping, create a prototyping plan for their concept, create a low-fidelity prototype of their solution, and test their low-fidelity prototype with a customer to gather feedback.</p>\r\n    Do you have questions? Send an email to <a href=\"mailto:hello@innovate-us.org\">hello@innovate-us.org</a>\r\n</div>",
