    "visible": 1,
    "summary": "<div style=\"padding:0 2rem\">\r\n    <h3>Certificate of Completion</h3>\r\n    <p>You did it!\r\n\r\n        You have completed the Human-Centered Design Course.&nbsp;You’ve tackled the key elements of the Human-Centered Design process, including:</p>\r\n    <p>\r\n    </p><ul>\r\n        <li><span style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem;\">&nbsp;Introduction to Human-Centered </span><span style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem;\">Design&nbsp;</span><br></li>\r\n        <li><span style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem;\">Empathize&nbsp;</span><br></li>\r\n        <li><span style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem;\">Define&nbsp;</span><br></li>\r\n        <li><span style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem;\">Ideate &nbsp;</span><br></li>\r\n        <li><span style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem;\">Prototype and Test</span><br></li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n    <p></p>\r\n    If you're unable to access the certificate, check if you have completed all the modules including the quizzes and surveys. If you are still unable to access the certificate, please get in touch with us at&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:hello@innovate-us.org\">hello@innovate-us.org</a>\r\n</div>",
